<title>SWEDEN: Average rate 4.066 pct on Swedish seven day T-bill.</title>
<headline>Average rate 4.066 pct on Swedish seven day T-bill.</headline>
<dateline>STOCKHOLM 1997-05-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>The average accepted rate in an auction of seven day Treasury bills was 4.066 percent, Sweden's National Debt Office said on Tuesday.</p>
<p>The highest accepted rate was 4.070 percent and the lowest rate was 4.065 percent.</p>
<p>The office had invited bids for a total of 11 billion crowns.</p>
<p>-- Stockholm newsroom +46-8-700-1017</p>
</text>
